      {
        "AlertId": "118659",
        "Headline": "New, Modern Clark/Lake Station Thompson Center Entrance Opens",
        "ShortDescription": "4am, Mon, Nov 23 - NEW station entrance to Clark/Lake opens. Old entrance south side of Lake St under 'L' tracks, mid-block btw Clark and LaSalle, will close.",
        "FullDescription": {
          "#cdata-section": "<p><strong>Effective 4am, Mon, Nov 23</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>NEW</strong>, modernized and fully accessible entrance to Clark/Lake will open to riders Monday morning. The new entrance is part of the historic redevelopment of the Thompson Center.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The new Thompson Center entrance is located on the southwest corner of Clark and Lake streets (194 N Clark); the old entrance on the south side of Lake Street under the elevated tracks, mid-block between Clark and LaSalle streets, will close as construction work continues.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The new Clark/Lake station entrance includes these features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&bull; <strong>Fare vending machines</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; <strong>New lighting</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; <strong>ADA accessible fare gate</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; <strong>New real-time alerts, elevator status and system status screens</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; <strong>New signage</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; <strong>Security cameras</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nRiders will see continued construction work both outside the building and past the station&rsquo;s paid area as the redevelopment of the Thompson Center proceeds.</p>\r\n"
        },
        "SeverityScore": "12",
        "SeverityColor": "000000",
